zaf-mpp is a Rust port of the read path of MPXJ (https://github.com/joniles/mpxj),
written and copyright by Jon Iles and the MPXJ contributors, originally
published by Packwood Software. All knowledge of the MPP14 binary format
encoded in this crate, including block layouts, field maps, and format
quirks, comes from the MPXJ source. This crate is licensed under the GNU
Lesser General Public License, version 2.1 or later, the same terms as
MPXJ itself.
